<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>third day of the third cricket test between England and</p>
<p>Australia at Old Trafford on Saturday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 235 (S.Waugh 108; D.Headley 4-72,</p>
<p>D.Gough 3-52)</p>
<p>England first innings (overnight 161-8)</p>
<p> M.Butcher st Healy b Bevan     51</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Healy b McGrath    5</p>
<p> A.Stewart c Taylor b Warne     30</p>
<p> N.Hussain c Healy b Warne	13</p>
<p> G.Thorpe c Taylor b Warne	 3</p>
<p> J.Crawley c Healy b Warne	 4</p>
<p> M.Ealham not out		   24</p>
<p> R.Croft c S.Waugh b McGrath     7</p>
<p> D.Gough lbw b Warne		 1</p>
<p> A.Caddick c M.Waugh b Warne    15</p>
<p> D.Headley b McGrath		 0</p>
<p> Extras  (b-4 lb-3 nb-2)	   9</p>
<p> Total (84 overs)		  162</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-8 2-74 3-94 4-101 5-110 6-111 7-122 8-123</p>
<p>9-161.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 23.4-9-40-3, Reiffel 9-3-14-0, Warne</p>
<p>30-14-48-6, Gillespie 14-3-39-0, Bevan 8-3-14-1.</p>
